{
  "status": "SPECIFICATION SAMPLES. Synthetic values only. Not output of a running engine, not a policy release, not runtime validation.",
  "purpose": "Reusable pre-tool check request and response pairs for consumers: Nour's contract test (success and failure paths), Malak's result fixtures and Mohab's route test.",
  "source": "Derived from the combined cases of policy-matrices.json (spec section 5.1) and kept in step with them by a test. Governance contract section 4.1 and 4.2 name the fields.",
  "notes": [
    "The request carries only the fields the three policies read. The full Trace Schema v1.9 policy_check event has more (the 19-key authorization snapshot, evidence references, ids and the attempt). This is not that event.",
    "Amounts are decimal strings. The threshold used by these samples is the test value 1000.00 USD, not the policy value.",
    "response.evaluated_policies[].reason_code is the governance reason code of every result. Trace Schema v1.9 has failure_or_error_reason for FAIL and ERROR only. Where the code of a PASS or NOT_APPLICABLE result is recorded is an open question for Mohab.",
    "policy_version and policy_bundle_version are left out until the policy versions are fixed."
  ],
  "samples": [
    {
      "id": "SAMPLE-01",
      "case": "CB-01",
      "kind": "success",
      "description": "Valid approved purchase above the threshold, stage APPROVED, supplier APPROVED: ALLOW.",
      "request": {
        "tool_name": "create_purchase_order",
        "checked_policy_stage": "APPROVED",
        "validated_arguments": { "total_amount": "1000.01", "currency": "USD", "supplier_id": "sup-1" },
        "supplier_evidence_ref": { "supplier_id": "sup-1", "supplier_status": "APPROVED" },
        "approval_evidence_ref": { "decision_status": "APPROVED" }
      },
      "response": {
        "check_mode": "ONLINE_PRE_TOOL",
        "evaluated_policies": [
          { "policy_id": "PROC-APPROVAL-01", "policy_result": "PASS", "criticality": "critical", "reason_code": "APPROVAL_VALID" },
          { "policy_id": "PROC-TOOL-STAGE-01", "policy_result": "PASS", "criticality": "critical", "reason_code": "TOOL_ALLOWED_IN_STAGE" },
          { "policy_id": "PROC-SUPPLIER-01", "policy_result": "PASS", "criticality": "critical", "reason_code": "SUPPLIER_APPROVED" }
        ],
        "action_verdict": "ALLOW",
        "verdict_basis": "ALL_APPLICABLE_PASSED"
      }
    },
